  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味が　強い　食材。甘さと　コクがあり　好物にしているポケモンが　多い　定番フルーツだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛이 강한 식재료. 단맛과 진한 맛이 있어 좋아하는 포켓몬이 많은 정석적인 과일이다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味強勁的食材。甜度和馥郁兼具，且廣受寶可夢喜愛，屬於國民級的水果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très sucré. Sa douceur unique en fait un fruit incontournable apprécié par de très nombreux Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine sehr süße Zutat. Aufgrund ihrer Süße und der charakteristischen Konsistenz ist diese Frucht der klare Favorit vieler Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una fruta que es muy popular entre los Pokémon por su dulzor y suculencia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto dolce. Un frutto di sicuro successo, amato da molti Pokémon per il suo gusto dolce e corposo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very sweet ingredient. This go-to fruit is sweet and rich, and it’s beloved by many Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
